    "description": {
      "content": "Create, list, retrieve, update (cancel/revoke), and manage SEPA-style customer e-mandates identified by a unique Reference Unique Mandate (RUM). Duplicate RUM submissions return 409 Conflict. Requires a dedicated E-Mandate access token.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Fintecture Support",
